{"id":"d6bb2c2e32c42b67","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Inverse Limit Forcing","display":"df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing — ZFC Inverse Limit Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing — ZFC Inverse Limit Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing — ZFC Inverse Limit Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,D_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec\\pi,\\vec X,\\vec R,\\vec 1\\in V\">\\(\\delta,D_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec\\pi,\\vec X,\\vec R,\\vec 1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InverseLimitForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{InverseLimitForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}index\\text{-}pairs}\\vdash\nD_\\delta\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta\\times\\delta:\n\\alpha\\in\\beta\\lor\\alpha=\\beta\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}index\\text{-}pairs}\\vdash\nD_\\delta\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta\\times\\delta:\n\\alpha\\in\\beta\\lor\\alpha=\\beta\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{InverseLimitForcing}_S\n(\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec\\pi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec R,\\vec 1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathbb P}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec R,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec R))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec 1))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha)=\n\\langle\\vec X(\\alpha),\\vec R(\\alpha),\\vec 1(\\alpha)\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{184pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\vec X(\\alpha),\\vec R(\\alpha),\\vec 1(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,D_\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\n\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D_\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),\n\\vec X(\\beta),\\vec X(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{93pt}\\land\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(\\vec 1(\\beta))=\\vec 1(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\vec X(\\beta)\\;\n(x\\mathrel{\\vec R(\\beta)}y\\to\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(x)\n\\mathrel{\\vec R(\\alpha)}\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(y))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle)\n=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\vec X(\\alpha)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;\\forall x\\in\\vec X(\\gamma)\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n(\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)(x))\n=\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathbb P_\\delta=\n\\left\\{p\\in\\left(\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X)\\right)^\\delta:\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;(p(\\alpha)\\in\\vec X(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(p(\\beta))=p(\\alpha)\n\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{InverseLimitForcing}_S\n(\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec\\pi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec R,\\vec 1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathbb P}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec R,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec R))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec 1))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha)=\n\\langle\\vec X(\\alpha),\\vec R(\\alpha),\\vec 1(\\alpha)\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{184pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\vec X(\\alpha),\\vec R(\\alpha),\\vec 1(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,D_\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\n\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D_\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),\n\\vec X(\\beta),\\vec X(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{93pt}\\land\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(\\vec 1(\\beta))=\\vec 1(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\vec X(\\beta)\\;\n(x\\mathrel{\\vec R(\\beta)}y\\to\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(x)\n\\mathrel{\\vec R(\\alpha)}\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(y))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle)\n=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\vec X(\\alpha)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;\\forall x\\in\\vec X(\\gamma)\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n(\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)(x))\n=\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathbb P_\\delta=\n\\left\\{p\\in\\left(\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X)\\right)^\\delta:\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;(p(\\alpha)\\in\\vec X(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(p(\\beta))=p(\\alpha)\n\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each stage is an explicit forcing-poset code. Bonding maps are typed, order preserving, top preserving, identity on the diagonal, and coherent under composition; the limit carrier is exactly their set of coherent threads.</li>\n<li>All coherence quantifiers are explicitly nested in descending index order, so their scopes no longer depend on a chained-binder convention.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-limitordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,D_\\delta,\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec\\pi,\\vec X,\\vec R,\\vec 1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InverseLimitForcing}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}index\\text{-}pairs}\\vdash\nD_\\delta\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in\\delta\\times\\delta:\n\\alpha\\in\\beta\\lor\\alpha=\\beta\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}limit\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{InverseLimitForcing}_S\n(\\mathbb P_\\delta,\\delta,\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\vec\\pi)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&\\quad \\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\exists\\vec X,\\vec R,\\vec 1\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec{\\mathbb P}))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec R,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec R))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec 1,\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec 1))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec{\\mathbb P}(\\alpha)=\n\\langle\\vec X(\\alpha),\\vec R(\\alpha),\\vec 1(\\alpha)\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{184pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\vec X(\\alpha),\\vec R(\\alpha),\\vec 1(\\alpha))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi,D_\\delta,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\pi))\n\\land\\forall\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in D_\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle),\n\\vec X(\\beta),\\vec X(\\alpha))\\\\\n&\\hspace{93pt}\\land\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(\\vec 1(\\beta))=\\vec 1(\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\vec X(\\beta)\\;\n(x\\mathrel{\\vec R(\\beta)}y\\to\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(x)\n\\mathrel{\\vec R(\\alpha)}\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(y))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle)\n=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in\\vec X(\\alpha)\\}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\beta\\in\\gamma\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;\\forall x\\in\\vec X(\\gamma)\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)\n(\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\beta,\\gamma\\rangle)(x))\n=\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\gamma\\rangle)(x)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathbb P_\\delta=\n\\left\\{p\\in\\left(\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec X)\\right)^\\delta:\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\delta\\;(p(\\alpha)\\in\\vec X(\\alpha))\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\beta\\;\n\\vec\\pi(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle)(p(\\beta))=p(\\alpha)\n\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3323,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2390","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-inverse-limit-forcing]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","81cabbac7fa4d75d","b5833df5ef175153"]}